            "detailed_description": "Horizon of History is an educational VR experience that will take you on a journey through the ages. <br><br>It's a virtual time machine that will teleport you between key periods of the history of Poland's capital city - Warsaw. <br><br>You will see Warsaw's panorama as it was in 11th, 14th, 16th centuries and after it's total destruction during the Second World War up until today. <br><br><strong>Each time period has various items and artifacts available for you to play with:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hit the Target With A Bow</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hack Wood With A Slavic Axe</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cut Vegetables With A Polish Saber</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shoot Targets With Deadly &quot;blyskawica&quot; Submachine Gun and More!</li></ul><br>Feel the history in your hands. Experience everyday tools and items from 1000 years of Warsaw's history. <br><br>The viewing point is located at a virtual recreation of the Warsaw's landmark building - the 44 story Palace of Culture and Science and it's famous observation deck.",
